:: T: VehVeh Fluxy Teacher [topic] {"position":"6900,1650","size":"100,100"}
{=

(storylet: when
(passage:) contains "NPC"
and $char's VehVeh's opinion's 2nd >= 10
and ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's quests, "sickTeacher", "") is "active"
and $char's player's timerCooldown does not contain "T: VehVeh Fluxy Teacher"
)

(urgency: 1)
(metadata:
"NPC", "VehVeh",
"title", "Discussing Your Ill Teacher with Veh-Veh",
"topic", [{
     (if: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "sickTeacher") < 1)["I'm traveling with my teacher, and he's not feeling well. He needs help."]
     (else:)["My teacher is still sick."]
}],
"topicDetail", "The Apesai school must have a spare tonic, or at least the equipment to make one.",
"cooldown", 1,
"talked", (a: "sickTeacher", "studentLab", "library", "absentPrincipal",),
"addCode", [],
)

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage: "S: VehVeh")'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s topicDetail)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[


<!--initialize: already have access?-->
(set: _alreadystudentLab to false)
(set: _alreadyLibrary to false)

(if: ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's att, "accessLighthouseStudentLab", 0) > 0)[
          (set: _alreadystudentLab to true)
]

(if: ($funcCheckExists: $char's player's att, "accessLighthouseLibrary", 0) > 0)[
     (set: _alreadyLibrary to true)
]



<!--topic line-->
$cssDesc[''You: //(print: (passage:)'s topic)//'']
<br>

<!--first time-->
(if: ($funcTalkedTimesCheck: "sickTeacher") < 1)[
["Oh no, what's wrong with him?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Many things, but she does not need to know that.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->\"He's been fluxy a few days before we arrived in Apesai.\"", "firstTime1",
     "<!--B-->\"It's too... embarrassing to divulge.\"", "firstTime2",
))
<br>

<!--firstTime1-->
[
["F- fluxy? And I assume you don't just mean..."]<VehVehLine| she points to her open mouth, making a gagging sound. ["Seasickness?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "<!--A-->You shake your head regrettably.", "firstTime1a",
))
<br>
](firstTime1|

<!--firstTime1a-->
[
["Ah, so..."]<VehVehLine| she points at her backside.
<br>
You aren't sure why she feels the need to demonstrate the alternative. You just nod.
<br>
["Yup, that's common for long boat trips, too. 'An excess of //Ab//,'' some call it."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->You don't //happen// to double as the school physician, right?\"", "firstTime3",
))
<br>
](firstTime1a|

<!--firstTime2-->
[
["How bad is it? What day was the departure? Did he put up a ward in front of his cabin? Did he meditate on a rainy day?-"]<VehVehLine| She stops herself when she sees you not answering.
<br>
To save her out of her own bind, you settle with calling it a "disagreeable bowel".
<br>
["Ooh..."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->You don't //happen// to double as the school physician, right?\"", "firstTime3",
))
<br>
](firstTime2|

[
["Me? Haha, no, no. We do have a hospitaler - well, close to one - but she's not on the island at the moment."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Veh-Veh then mutters, ["I //do// double as an astrologian though."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->This hospitaler - do you know if she'll come back soon?\"", "firstTime3a",
     "\"<!--B-->Astrology... would it help with, you know...\"", "firstTime3b",
     "\"<!--C-->Is there medicine inside the tower?\"", "firstTime3c",
))
<br>
](firstTime3|

<!--firstTime3a-->
[
["No, she's with the principal, they've gone off..."]<VehVehLine| she mutters. It seems to be an oft-asked question and an oft-given answer. ["Look, if your teacher is just having a bad stomach, then a Gor tonic is good enough. Our hospitaler makes them all the time for the children when they're... um... You //do// know how to operate a synthesis workstation, yes? As in, unsupervised?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->Of course! I'm already a journeyman.\"", "workstation1",
     "\"<!--B-->Make my own? Don't you have any spare tonic? Must you make a guest from far away //work// for it?\"", "firstTime3c",
))
<br>
](firstTime3a|

<!--firstTime3b-->
[
["That's not what- I can help you pick the right time to travel if you want to avoid getting sick. But if you - well, your teacher, in this case - have already gotten sick, then..."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
You should have known this, being a graduate and all. But the truth is that the disciplines are numerous, and each of them claims to be able to do a thousand things.
<br>
["Beside, I'm more of a eudaimonia astrology person,"]<VehVehLine| she adds.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->What about medicine? The school has to have some stocked, yes?\"", "firstTime3c",
))
<br>
](firstTime3b|

<!--firstTime3c-->
[
["Sorry, there isn't any spare medicine left on account of our hospitaler being away. We - well, //I// - make them as needed, but the coffer's locked, and everyone's coin purses are light,"]<VehVehLine| she sighs.` `

(if: _alreadystudentLab is false)[["I can tell the attendants to let you into our lab though."]<VehVehLine|]
(else:)["But, you know, the student lab is open to you if you don't mind rolling up your sleeves a bit."]<VehVehLine|

<br>
You are not sure what surprises you more - the fact that a school could have such a poor chemical inventory, or the fact that a senior apprentice can freely give a stranger access to their laboratory.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->Yes, if it's no trouble, I'd like to use the lab please.\"", "workstation1",
))
<br>
](firstTime3c|
]<!--end of first time-->



<!--second time onward-->
(else:)[
["Oh no, still? Have you made a Gor tonic yet? Have you given it to him?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->Not yet.\"", "notYet",
))
<br>

<!--notYet-->
[
["There you go! That's the problem, isn't it?"]<VehVehLine| She sounds almost relieved. ["First part to testing a hypothesis is, well, //testing// it."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
She says it slowly. This is clearly a teaching moment for her.
<br>
["Anyway, you know where the student lab is, don't you?"]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--B-->Yes, I still do,\" you say, feeling a bit silly. \"Thanks though.\"", "done",
     "\"<!--A-->Could you remind me, please?\"", "workstation1",
))
<br>
](notYet|

]<!--end of second time onward-->

<!--gainAccess sequence-->
(if: _alreadystudentLab is false)[
<!--workstation1-->
[
["Great! Go up about five floors, past the auditorium and the dorms, you'll see the door to our student lab. Can't miss it; there's a safety poster in front with big letters. I'll make sure those cranky attendants get the message."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->A //student// lab? You don't mean the one the children uses, do you?\"", "workstation2a",
     "\"<!--B-->What if I need to make more advanced subtances?\"", "workstation2b",
     "\"<!--C-->A student lab... sure. I'll take what I can get.\"", "workstation2c",
))
<br>
](workstation1|

<!--workstation2a-->
[
["Yes, the very one. Apprentices of all ages here use the same facilities,"]<VehVehLine| she sounds defensive.` `
(t8n:"dissolve")(show:?workstation3)
](workstation2a|

<!--workstation2b-->
[
["Then I suppose you'll need to take a hike down to the market for an actual apothecary. Apesai's got a Grand Exchange, you know,"]<VehVehLine| she says, slightly annoyed.` `
(t8n:"dissolve")(show:?workstation3)
](workstation2b|

<!--workstation2c-->
[
["Yeah... not the stuff that would impress a visitor from the heartlands, I know,"]<VehVehLine| she seems genuinely embarrassed.` `
(t8n:"dissolve")(show:?workstation3)
](workstation2c|


<!--workstation3-->
[
["Our only research-grade laboratory is in the very top floor in the principal's office, but the door's locked, and no-one has the key right now. It's a long story."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Stranger and stranger.
<br>
["The student lab is perfectly fine if you're only making a couple of simple tonics or salves at a time. We've got an elementalysis table too, if you're wondering."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
Machinery is one thing. There's also the matter of ingredients.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->And is there an ingredient storeroom in there too?\"", "workstation4a",
     "\"<!--B-->That's good to hear. Thank you. I'll figure it the rest out.\"", "workstation4b",
))
<br>
](workstation3|

<!--workstation4a-->
[
["No again, haha. If you keep asking, I'll keep disappointing. Well, actually, there is a larder where we keep ingredients, but we're down to our last few scraps right now, and the children still need them for their lessons."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
She points vaguely in the direction of the red steel domes some distance downhill and says, ["On the other hand, there's //everything// down there. Not for free though."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->Point taken.\"", "workstation4b",
))
<br>
](workstation4a|

<!--workstation4b-->
[
["Yes, and if you need to brush up on your alchemical formulas, do visit our library one floor above. The children love it, and- Oh, I don't mean to say that you don't know how to, you know... Forget I said anything."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->...\"", "gainAccess",
     "\"<!--A-->Done, already forgotten.\"", "gainAccess",
     "\"<!--B-->No, that's actually quite helpful. Libraries are great, and everyone needs revision from time to time.\"", "gainAccess",
))
<br>
](workstation4b|

<!--gainAccess-->
[
She thumbs the hem of her cape for a bit, not knowing what to say.
<br>
["Anyway, let me just..."]<VehVehLine| she holds up an amulet and whispers an incantation. Its colors shift. ["There you go. Up the stairs and walk straight in."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
$cssDesc[You can now access the ''student lab'' - a tentative place for you to work your magic - and ''library'' - where many useful books can be found - at the Apesai Lighthouse.]
<br>
["Oh, and one last thing: Since I couldn't help out more,"]<VehVehLine| she pulls from her coat pocket a small gut skin bag, the content inside glowing a faint red. ["Take my leftover vehzin. It's not a lot, but the student lab doesn't need much fuel either. Should be enough for a full synthesis cycle."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
$cssDesc[You also receive a ''(print: (passage: "item.vehzin")'s id)'' - standard fuel for many magical machineries.]
<br>
---
(link: "\"This is a lot already. Gratitude, Veh-Veh.\"")[{
     <!--registers all "talked" keys-->
     ($funcTalked:)
     <!--put the crafting topic on cooldown-->
     ($funcAddStoryletCooldown: (passage:)'s name)

     <!--receive vehzin-->
     ($funcGainLoss: "item.", "vehzin", 1)

     <!--gain acces to lab-->
     (if: _alreadystudentLab is false)[
          ($funcGainLoss: "att.", "accessLighthouseStudentLab", 1)
     ]

     <!--gain access to library-->
     (if: _alreadyLibrary is false)[
          ($funcGainLoss: "att.", "accessLighthouseLibrary", 1)
     ]
     (goto: "VehVeh Fluxy Teacher (End)")
}]

](gainAccess|
]<!--end of accessLighthouseStudentLab sequence (including workstation dialog)-->


<!--already have accessLighthouseStudentLab-->
(else:)[
<!--workstation1 (alternative, but with same name)-->
[
["Sure, like I said: fifth floor - just walk straight in. I've already made sure that the attendants stand down,"]<VehVehLine| she says. ["If they don't, then I'll have to go find one of the associate teachers, and... And we'd have a bigger problem on our hands. //I'd// have a bigger problem on //my// hands."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
She's muttering to herself again.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--A-->And if I need a reference book? You know, just to check if formulas aren't different here in Askava?\"", "library",
     "\"<!--B-->Gratitude, Veh-Veh.\"", "done",
))
<br>
](workstation1|

[
You try your best to avoid sounding like you have forgotten the formulas.
<br>
["Aren't formulas... the same everywhere? That's why they're 'formulas', right?"]<VehVehLine| She tilts her head. ["Or maybe the formulas are the same, but there are regional differences in what we call the products? Ah, still got a lot to learn. Library's a floor above the lab."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
     "\"<!--B-->Gratitude, Veh-Veh.\"", "done",
))
<br>
](library|

]<!--end of already have accessLighthouseStudentLab-->


<!--done-->
[
<br>
["Not a problem. Sorry to hear about your teacher. I wish I could do more to help."]<VehVehLine|
<br>
$cssDesc[You already have access the ''student lab'' - a tentative place for you to work your magic - and ''library'' - where many useful books can be found - at the Apesai Lighthouse.]
<br>
---
<ol>
($funcNPCTopics: "Veh-Veh seems regretful for not doing more. Any more, and you'll just make her feel worse.", "You've been of great help, Veh-Veh. Bye.")
</ol>
](done|

]<!--end child-->
]<!--end parent-->